What goes wrong without `onUnmounted` here?

```ts
onMounted(() => {
  window.addEventListener('keydown', handleKey)
})
```

This watcher never saves after `products.value.push(...)`. Why?

```ts
watch(products, (latest) => {
  localStorage.setItem('products', JSON.stringify(latest))
})
```

This detail page always says "not found". Why?

```ts
const route = useRoute()
const product = products.value.find(p => p.id === route.params.id)
```

What's wrong here?

```ts
function loadProducts() {
  const response = await fetch(url)
  products.value = await response.json()
}
```

`data` shows as `Promise {<pending>}` instead of the products:

```ts
const response = await fetch('https://fakestoreapi.com/products')
const data = response.json()
```
